efeat the oncoming monsters through a combination of melee claw strikes, long-range ammo and skill releases. You can also use your anger to enter a &quot;Super State&quot;, which allows you to quickly kill a large number of enemies with a snap of your fingers!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1280380/extras/48160b1a6c1da9109815c033e4c59caf.poster.avif?t=1735638167\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1280380/extras/48160b1a6c1da9109815c033e4c59caf.webm?t=1735638167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1280380/extras/48160b1a6c1da9109815c033e4c59caf.mp4?t=1735638167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
